# Scope — Plan 0002

> Add three independent todo features at once, so the run exercises a fully parallel task graph.

## Why this plan

The second plan shows that when tasks have no dependencies and disjoint footprints, Makina dispatches them concurrently up to the configured `concurrency` limit. All three tasks land independently and merge without ordering constraints.

## In scope

- **0002 — Todo Features.** Add a list module, a render module, and a tags module — each in its own file, each with no dependencies.

## Out of scope

- Wiring the new modules into `main` (that belongs to Plan 0003) and any change to `src/main.rs`.